1. To search any word using wild character *
 =>  ls file1.* < it will search everything starts with file1
 =>  ls *.pdf   <  it will search everything ends with .pdf
2. to create  multiple files/folder
=> touch linux{1..30}.pdf < it will create Linux1 to Linux 30 in one go
=> ls linux*.*   < it will list all files start with linux.
=> rm linux{1..10}.pdf < it will remove files contains linux1 to linux10 only
3. To search single character
=> ls ?123  < it will list the string with123 in one character
=> ls ????? < it will search only 5 character strings/numbers
=> ls [abcde]*  < it will list all files that starts with a,b,c,d,e

important points :- Always list before deleting any file
